{"id":3369,"date":"2026-06-22T14:50:01","date_gmt":"2026-06-22T14:50:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3369"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:09:45","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:09:45","slug":"buddha-mosaic-designer-wall-tile","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/buddha-mosaic-designer-wall-tile\/","title":{"rendered":"Buddha Mosaic Designer Wall Tile"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"1137\">Jain Stones &amp; Tiles presents the <strong data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"717\">Buddha Mosaic Designer Wall Tile Panel<\/strong>, a premium decorative wall tile solution crafted for spaces that demand artistic expression, calming aesthetics, and luxury architectural detailing. Inspired by timeless spiritual artwork and contemporary mosaic craftsmanship, this exclusive wall panel showcases a beautifully detailed Buddha portrait created through precision mosaic tile patterning that transforms ordinary walls into sophisticated design statements.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1539\">Designed using carefully arranged premium mosaic tile segments in elegant beige, ivory, earthy brown, and subtle neutral tones, this decorative panel creates a visually rich composition that combines spirituality with modern interior design aesthetics. The intricate handcrafted appearance adds texture, artistic depth, and architectural elegance, making it a striking centerpiece for premium spaces.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"2066\">Manufactured using high-quality wall tile materials with superior finish consistency and long-lasting durability, this designer tile panel offers excellent structural performance, low maintenance requirements, and premium visual appeal for long-term interior applications. Ideal for luxury residential interiors, wellness spaces, meditation rooms, hospitality projects, reception walls, boutique commercial interiors, and bespoke architectural environ